      "data": {
        "text": "\"Task specifications (listed alphabetically; implement only the requested file):\nconditional_update.py - applies a conditional or version-aware update to one stored document\ndatabase_client.py - Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Managed NoSQL Document Store\ndatabase_models.py - Define local request, response, and normalization helpers for Managed NoSQL Document Store\nfetch_document.py - fetches a document by identifier from a managed NoSQL store\nquery_documents.py - queries documents by a field value or partition-style key\nrecord_export_archive.py - Archive exported document snapshots or attachments in managed object storage\nrecord_summary.py - Summarize retrieved document records\nrecord_text_safety.py - Check user-generated document fields for unsafe content\nrecord_translate.py - Translate user-facing document fields\nupsert_document.py - upserts a JSON document by its primary identifier\n\nCreate fetch_document.py in the current working directory.\nTask: fetches a document by identifier from a managed NoSQL store.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
